."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Main scheme is at 4/7 and I can't remove threat from it while Crowd Control is in play. Being in hero form during the villain phase makes Rhino attack me instead of scheming, and I need hero form to use Web Kick."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Black Cat\u003eCrowd Control","reasoning":"Black Cat thwarts Crowd Control to start clearing the crisis, which blocks removing threat from the main scheme. She takes 1 consequential damage but survives at 1 HP."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Spider-Man\u003eCrowd Control","reasoning":"Spider-Man thwarts Crowd Control again, removing its last threat so the side scheme is defeated and the crisis goes away."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Energy+Enhanced Spider-Sense","reasoning":"Crowd Control is gone, so I can now damage the main scheme or villain. Web Kick deals 8 to Rhino (13 to 5). Paying with Energy and Spider-Sense keeps Aunt May and the second Web Kick."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Spent resources efficiently; Aunt May costs a valuable card to play now and I can't change form again this turn. End turn."},{"round":2,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Hand is under hand size, and all three cards are useful. Keep them and draw up."},{"round":2,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Defending with Spider-Man reduces damage by his DEF 3, which should cover Rhino's base 2 plus most boost. Black Cat has 1 HP and would die."},{"round":2,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Black Cat has 1 HP and would die absorbing Vulture's attack. Taking 3 on Spider-Man (10 HP) is the better trade."},{"round":2,"kind":"window","key":"play:Backflip","reasoning":"Backflip costs 0 and prevents all 3 damage from Vulture's attack."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Black Cat\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Must reduce main scheme threat from 5 to 4; otherwise the villain phase's +2 (per-round plus Highway Robbery acceleration) reaches 7 and I lose. Black Cat will probably die from the consequential damage, but this is required."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eVulture|pay:Emergency+Mockingbird+Nick Fury","reasoning":"Web Kick's 8 damage kills Vulture (4 HP), removing the 3-ATK quickstrike attacker. Rhino stays at 5 HP so stage 2 (15 HP, search trigger) doesn't come out yet. Paying with Emergency, Mockingbird, and Nick Fury."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Staying in hero form keeps Rhino attacking rather than scheming, so the villain phase adds only the 2 forced threat (4 to 6) instead of pushing it to 7 and losing."},{"round":3,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man's DEF 3 should absorb Rhino's attack of 2 plus boost, avoiding damage."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Jessica Jones|pay:Interrogation Room+The Power of Justice","reasoning":"Jessica Jones is the only way to thwart the main scheme this turn (Spider-Man is exhausted). Her THW is 2 with Highway Robbery in play, which brings threat from 6 to 4 so the villain phase's +2 leaves me at 6, not 7."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Jessica Jones\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Jessica Jones thwarts The Break-In! for 2 (THW 2 with one side scheme in play), taking threat from 6 to 4. She takes 1 consequential damage."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"No further safe plays: Spider-Man is exhausted, and the remaining cards are better held. Main scheme at 4 leaves room for the +2 villain phase increase."},{"round":4,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep the hand; all cards have some use and I'm at hand size."},{"round":4,"kind":"window","key":"play:Great Responsibility","reasoning":"Trading 2 HP for 2 threat keeps the main scheme at 4/7. Spider-Man has 9 HP, and a threat of 6 would put me one villain phase from losing."},{"round":4,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man's DEF 3 cuts Rhino's ATK 5 (with Charge) down to about 2 plus boost, keeping Jessica Jones available."},{"round":4,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Jessica Jones","reasoning":"Spider-Man is at 4 HP and cannot defend (exhausted). Rhino's 2 base plus boost could deal up to 4 and kill my identity. Jessica Jones absorbs it, though she will likely be defeated."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:For Justice!\u003eThe Break-In!|pay:Great Responsibility+Web-Shooter","reasoning":"For Justice! paid with a mental resource (Great Responsibility) removes 4 threat from The Break-In!, taking it from 4 to 0. That leaves plenty of room against the +2 villain-phase increase. Keeping First Aid for healing at 4 HP."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:First Aid\u003eSpider-Man|pay:Webbed Up","reasoning":"First Aid heals Spider-Man 2 (4 to 6 HP). Paying with Webbed Up, which I can't afford to play this turn anyway."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Staying in hero form lets Spider-Man defend Rhino's attack with DEF 3. Scheming in alter-ego form would push threat up by 3 with no defense."},{"round":5,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep Daredevil; he's a useful ally."},{"round":5,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Defend with DEF 3 to absorb Rhino's attack."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Surveillance Team|pay:Strength","reasoning":"Surveillance Team can be paid with Strength, a card I can't otherwise use this turn. It gives me a repeatable threat removal on the main scheme, and I keep Spider-Sense, Mansion, and Haymaker."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Surveillance Team","reasoning":"Remove 1 threat from The Break-In! now (2 to 1) to widen the safety margin."},{"round":6,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Surveillance Team\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Main scheme is the loss condition. Its threat is 2 and grows by 2 per round from the per-round amount plus Highway Robbery's acceleration, so I'll remove threat from it."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Haymaker\u003eShocker|pay:Avengers Mansion+Enhanced Spider-Sense","reasoning":"Haymaker's 3 damage defeats Shocker (3 HP), removing a recurring attacker. Paying with Avengers Mansion and Spider-Sense keeps Daredevil for defense and thwarting."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Remaining cards are low value; ending turn in hero form to block with Spider-Man."},{"round":6,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep Daredevil and draw up."},{"round":6,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Defend with DEF 3 to block Rhino's attack."},{"round":6,"kind":"window","key":"play:Backflip","reasoning":"Backflip prevents all damage from this attack, saving the last point of damage."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Tenacity+The Power of Justice+Webbed Up","reasoning":"Web Kick's 8 damage defeats Rhino (5 HP) and removes the Charge-boosted attacker before it hits Spider-Man at 5 HP. Paying with Tenacity, Power of Justice, and Webbed Up keeps Daredevil."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Surveillance Team","reasoning":"Remove 1 threat from The Break-In! (3 to 2) before the villain phase adds 2 more. Staying in hero form keeps Rhino attacking instead of scheming."},{"round":7,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Surveillance Team\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Main scheme is the loss condition; reduce its threat from 3 to 2."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Staying in hero form so Spider-Man can defend against Rhino's attack."},{"round":7,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep Daredevil and draw up."},{"round":7,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Not defending means taking 6+ damage at 5 HP, which is fatal. Defending reduces it by 3, leaving 3 plus boost."}],"log":["Setup: Spider-Man vs Rhino (The Break-In!).","P