 and cancels 1 of the 3 threat Rhino is scheming, slowing the Break-In! clock. Free value."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Daredevil\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Daredevil thwarts the main scheme for 2 threat (3 to 1) while the Rhino clock is building. Confusion may eat this, but it is the most valuable use of his exhaust."},{"round":2,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Daredevil\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Daredevil's thwart bonus: deal 1 damage to Rhino."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"play:First Aid\u003eDaredevil|pay:Peter Parker(ability)","reasoning":"Daredevil at 1 HP would die to the next hit. First Aid heals 2 and Peter's free mental resource pays for it, leaving my hand intact."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Peter's mental resource is spent and no further useful plays are affordable. Ending the turn to draw up."},{"round":2,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep all five cards in hand; none are worth discarding and hand size is 6."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Daredevil\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Threat is 4/7 and climbing; Daredevil is ready at full HP. Thwart removes 2 threat. Confusion only affects hero thwarts, so this works."},{"round":3,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Daredevil\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Daredevil's bonus damage to Rhino."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Remaining options cost two or more cards for little gain. Ending the turn keeps Web Kick and For Justice! for later."},{"round":3,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep full hand; no discards needed."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Daredevil\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Threat 6/7 with at least 2 incoming next villain phase plus hazard. Daredevil thwarts main scheme for 2, bringing it to 4. Ally thwarts aren't affected by my confusion."},{"round":4,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Daredevil\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Daredevil's bonus damage to Rhino."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Threat 4/7 with scheme incoming (plus boost and hazard card) could reach the threshold. In hero form Rhino attacks instead of scheming, so no scheme threat is placed. Spider-Man's Spider-Sense also draws a card when attacked."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Avengers Mansion+Tenacity+Webbed Up","reasoning":"Swinging Web Kick deals 8 to Rhino (10 to 2). Paying with Avengers Mansion, Tenacity and Webbed Up keeps For Justice! for a later thwart, and Spider-Man stays ready to defend."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Keep Spider-Man ready to defend against Rhino's attack this villain phase. Rhino at 2 HP can be finished next turn."},{"round":4,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Hand size is 5 in Spider-Man form; keep both cards and draw up."},{"round":4,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man's DEF 3 should reduce Rhino's ATK 2 plus boost to little or nothing. Daredevil at 1 HP would die."}],"log":["Setup: Spider-Man vs Rhino (The Break-In!).","Peter Parker draws 6 card(s).","Player chose: Keep this hand","--- Player turn, round 1 ---","Player chose: Play Daredevil, paying: discard Spider-Tracer [energy]; discard Interrogation Room [energy]; discard Heroic Intuition [energy]; use Peter Parker [mental]","Played Daredevil.","Player chose: Ally attack: Daredevil deals 2 damage to Rhino (exhaust; takes 1 consequential damage)","Daredevil attacks Rhino for 2.","Rhino takes 2 damage (12 HP left).","Daredevil takes 1 damage.","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Done discarding; draw up to hand size","Peter Parker draws 4 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 1 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 1).","Boost card revealed: Bomb Scare (+2).","Rhino schemes for 3.","Player chose: Play Emergency","Played Emergency.","2 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 3).","Encounter card revealed: False Alarm (treachery).","Peter