{"run_id":"20261016T161105Z","scenario":"spider-man-vs-rhino","player":"model:claude-haiku-5-5@effort-medium","instructions":{"names":["rules"],"sha256":"51f76cb90b2add15"},"seed":5,"sample":0,"status":"lost","rounds":8,"decisions":39,"stats":{"allies":0,"decisions":39,"hand":5,"hero_hp":2,"hero_max_hp":10,"lost":1,"main_target":7,"main_threat":8,"minions":1,"over":1,"round":8,"side_schemes":2,"side_threat":5,"villain_damage":0,"villain_hp":14,"villain_hp_total":29,"villain_total_hp":29,"won":0},"criteria":{"hero_hp":0.2,"speed":0,"threat":0,"villain_damage":0,"win":0},"score":0.020000000000000004,"usage":{"requests":49,"input_tokens":1526105,"output_tokens":49038,"cached_tokens":1467191},"ms":296524,"choices":[{"round":1,"kind":"mulligan","key":"mulligan:keep","reasoning":"Hand has attack (Swinging Web Kick), two thwarts (For Justice!), defense (Backflip x2) and a mental-cost support; reasonable keep."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Playing Avengers Mansion requires discarding 3-4 cards from a hand of 6, which would wreck my resources. Ending turn keeps the attack and thwart cards for later."},{"round":1,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Hand is at size 6 with no reason to discard; keep all cards and draw up."},{"round":1,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Hydra Bomber\u003edamage","reasoning":"Threat on a 7-threshold scheme is hard to remove; 2 damage on a 10 HP alter-ego can be healed with Recover."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"recover:Peter Parker","reasoning":"Heal the 2 damage taken with Recover; it readies at end of turn so no real cost."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"No affordable plays; Peter exhausted from Recover. End turn and keep hand."},{"round":2,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Hand is full and every card is useful; keep all and draw up to 6."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Threat 6/7 would lose next villain phase. Need hero form to thwart; first thwart clears confusion."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:For Justice!\u003eThe Break-In!|pay:Avengers Mansion+Backflip","reasoning":"First For Justice! is replaced by discarding the confuse status; this clears confusion so the second thwart works. Paying Backflip + Avengers Mansion."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:For Justice!\u003eThe Break-In!|pay:Backflip+Swinging Web Kick","reasoning":"Threat 6/7 must be cut. For Justice! paid with mental (Web Kick) removes 4 -\u003e threat 2, and keeps Spider-Man ready for defense unlike a basic thwart."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eHydra Bomber","reasoning":"Hydra Bomber has 2 HP; basic attack deals 2 and kills it, removing an extra threat source and attacker."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Nothing else useful to do; end turn."},{"round":3,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Threat is 2/7 and far from loss; save Great Responsibility for a larger threat placement when it matters more than damage."},{"round":3,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Defend with Spider-Man: DEF 3 vs ATK 2 blocks the base damage; he readies next turn."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Black Cat|pay:Genius","reasoning":"Play Black Cat (thwart/attack body) paying with Genius, keeping wild and Great Responsibility; her ETB may draw mental cards from deck."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Black Cat\u003eBomb Scare","reasoning":"Bomb Scare accelerates main scheme threat every villain phase; start removing its 3 threat with Black Cat."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Tenacity would cost three valuable cards for one thwart; end turn instead."},{"round":4,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep all cards and draw up to hand size of 5."},{"round":4,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Threat 3/7 is safe; keep Great Responsibility for a bigger spike."},{"round":4,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man DEF 3 absorbs Rhino's 2 base ATK fully; keeps Black Cat alive for thwarts while threat is critical."},{"round":4,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Do not defend with Black Cat; she would die (1 HP vs 3 damage) and she is needed for thwarting at 5/7 threat. Spider-Man's 10 HP can absorb it."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Jessica Jones|pay:Strength+The Power of Justice","reasoning":"Threat 5/7 with Bomb Scare accelerating +1 and base +1 next villain phase. Jessica Jones (THW 2 with a side scheme in play) can thwart the main scheme this turn. Paying with Power of Justice + Strength."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Jessica Jones\u003eBomb Scare","reasoning":"Jessica removes 2 from Bomb Scare (2 threat) defeating it and ending its acceleration permanently."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Black Cat at 1 HP would die from her thwart; keep her for a later defend/thwart. Threat 5/7 with only base +1 per round now."},{"round":5,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand and draw up to 5."},{"round":5,"kind":"window","key":"play:Great Responsibility","reasoning":"Threat at 5/7 with unknown encounter cards still to come; converting 1 threat into 1 damage keeps the loss threshold out of reach. Spider-Man has 6 HP."},{"round":5,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man DEF 3 absorbs base 2 ATK; allies would take full damage and die."},{"round":5,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Black Cat","reasoning":"Spider-Man is exhausted and at 5 HP; taking 3+ from Vulture is too dangerous. Black Cat (1 HP, least valuable) absorbs it."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Jessica Jones\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Main threat 5/7; next villain phase adds +2 (base + Highway Robbery acceleration). Jessica thwarts main for 2 -\u003e 3, so it reaches 5 not 7. Only ready hero-side option available; Spider-Man is exhausted."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Staying in hero form so villains attack rather than scheme; switching to alter-ego would let Rhino and Vulture add threat (3 + 2 + 2 = 7 loss risk)."},{"round":6,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand, draw up to 5."},{"round":6,"kind":"window","key":"play:Great Responsibility","reasoning":"Threat 3/7 about to rise by 2 and acceleration adds more each round; converting 2 threat to 2 damage keeps the loss threshold out of reach, and Aunt May can heal the damage."},{"round":6,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man DEF 3 absorbs most of Rhino's attack; Jessica at 2 HP would die to full damage."},{"round":6,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Jessica Jones","reasoning":"Taking 3 at 3 HP would defeat Spider-Man; Jessica must absorb the attack."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Webbed Up\u003eVulture|pay:Aunt May+Enhanced Spider-Sense+Surveillance Team+Tenacity","reasoning":"Webbed Up on Vulture cancels its 3-ATK attack (stuns instead). Spider-Man can then defend Rhino with DEF 3. Staying in hero form avoids the scheme-based threat spike that would lose the game. Costs my hand, but survival is the priority at 3 HP."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Nothing else affordable or useful; end turn with Webbed Up on Vulture."},{"round":7,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Defend with Spider-Man: DEF 3 absorbs Rhino's base 2; not defending at 3 HP is lethal-risky."},{"round":8,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"No card in hand can reduce main-scheme threat (Crowd Control crisis) or deal with Highway Robbery; Spider-Man is exhausted. Nothing productive remains; end turn and see the villain phase."},{"round":8,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand and draw up to 5 to look for any out."}],"log":["Setup: Spider-Man vs Rhino (The Break-In!).","Peter Parker draws 6 card(s).","Player chose: Keep this hand","--- Player turn, round 1 ---","Player chos