on.","Player chose: Change form to Spider-Man (once per turn)","Peter Parker changes form to Spider-Man.","Player chose: Basic thwart: Spider-Man removes 2 threat from Crowd Control (exhaust Spider-Man)","Spider-Man thwarts Crowd Control for 2.","2 threat removed from Crowd Control (now 0).","Crowd Control is defeated.","Player chose: Play For Justice! targeting The Break-In!, paying: discard Swinging Web Kick [mental]; discard Swinging Web Kick [mental]","Played For Justice!.","Spider-Man thwarts The Break-In! for 4.","4 threat removed from The Break-In! (now 0).","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Done discarding; draw up to hand size","Spider-Man draws 4 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 6 ---","Player chose: Do not respond","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 1).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Defend with Spider-Man (exhaust; DEF 3 reduces the damage)","Boost card revealed: I'm Tough (+0).","Rhino's attack has 2 ATK.","Spider-Man defends, reducing the damage by 3.","Encounter card revealed: Sandman (minion).","Sandman engages Spider-Man.","Sandman gains a tough status.","--- End of round. Round 7 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 7 ---","Player chose: Play First Aid targeting Mockingbird, paying: discard Webbed Up [physical]","Played First Aid.","Mockingbird heals 2 damage (3 HP left).","Player chose: Ally thwart: Mockingbird removes 1 threat from The Break-In! (exhaust; takes 1 consequential damage)","Mockingbird thwarts The Break-In! for 1.","1 threat removed from The Break-In! (now 0).","Mockingbird takes 1 damage.","Player chose: Change form to Peter Parker (once per turn)","Spider-Man changes form to Peter Parker.","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Done discarding; draw up to hand size","Peter Parker draws 2 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 7 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 1).","Boost card revealed: Breakin' \u0026 Takin' (+2).","Rhino schemes for 3.","3 threat placed on 