{"run_id":"20261016T161105Z","scenario":"spider-man-vs-rhino","player":"model:claude-haiku-5-5@effort-medium","instructions":{"names":["rules"],"sha256":"51f76cb90b2add15"},"seed":4,"sample":0,"status":"lost","rounds":15,"decisions":103,"stats":{"allies":0,"decisions":103,"hand":6,"hero_hp":0,"hero_max_hp":10,"lost":1,"main_target":7,"main_threat":4,"minions":2,"over":1,"round":15,"side_schemes":2,"side_threat":6,"villain_damage":0,"villain_hp":14,"villain_hp_total":29,"villain_total_hp":29,"won":0},"criteria":{"hero_hp":0,"speed":0,"threat":0.4285714285714286,"villain_damage":0,"win":0},"score":0.042857142857142864,"usage":{"requests":126,"input_tokens":14259054,"output_tokens":84847,"cached_tokens":14059294},"ms":594253,"choices":[{"round":1,"kind":"mulligan","key":"mulligan:keep","reasoning":"Hand has Genius (2 mental), Mockingbird, Spider-Sense, Great Responsibility, Interrogation Room, Power of Justice. Resource-light but playable with Peter's once-per-round mental ability; a single-card mulligan isn't clearly better, so keep."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Mockingbird|pay:Genius+Peter Parker(ability)","reasoning":"Mockingbird costs 3. Paying with Genius (2 mental) plus Peter's once-per-round mental ability keeps Great Responsibility, Spider-Sense, Interrogation Room and Power of Justice in hand. Her ETB stun is useful against Rhino."},{"round":1,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Mockingbird\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Only option: stun Rhino."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Mockingbird\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Rhino is stunned and we are in alter-ego form, so the villain will scheme rather than attack this round. Mockingbird can chip 1 damage while there is no defense need, and she heals or is ready next turn."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Interrogation Room only helps after a minion is defeated, so I'll hold my cards and end the turn."},{"round":1,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep all cards; hand size is 6 and I want to draw up."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Nick Fury|pay:Enhanced Spider-Sense+Great Responsibility+Peter Parker(ability)+The Power of Justice","reasoning":"Play Nick Fury to remove 2 threat from The Break-In! Paying with Great Responsibility, Power of Justice (wild), Spider-Sense, and Peter's ability keeps Interrogation Room in hand."},{"round":2,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Nick Fury\u003ethwart","reasoning":"Threat is at 3 of 7. Removing 2 keeps the scheme low. Dealing damage would just be absorbed by Armored Rhino Suit."},{"round":2,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Nick Fury\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Only target."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Nick Fury\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Nick Fury is discarded at round end, so spend his exhaust to remove the last 1 threat (he only removes up to 2) and clear the scheme."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Threat is 0. Mockingbird's attack would be absorbed by the Rhino Suit and she would take consequential damage, so end the turn."},{"round":2,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand and draw up."},{"round":2,"kind":"window","key":"play:Emergency","reasoning":"Emergency is free (cost 0) and cuts Rhino's 2 scheme threat to 1."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Aunt May|pay:Peter Parker(ability)","reasoning":"Use Peter's free mental resource to play Aunt May (cost 1). It's a support that can heal 4 later, and it's the only use for that resource this turn."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Mockingbird\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Threat is 3 of 7 and climbing each round. Mockingbird's thwart removes 1 at the cost of 1 HP, which is worth it to keep the scheme away from the threshold."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"No further useful plays affordable; end turn and draw up."},{"round":3,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand and draw up."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Threat is 5/7. In hero form, Rhino attacks me instead of scheming, which avoids its scheme threat. This also unlocks hero-form thwart options like For Justice! to remove threat now."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:For Justice!\u003eThe Break-In!|pay:Surveillance Team+Web-Shooter","reasoning":"For Justice! paid with a mental resource removes 4 threat from The Break-In! (5 down to 1). Surveillance Team and Web-Shooter are the least critical cards to spend."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Spider-Man\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Basic thwart removes 1 more threat, bringing The Break-In! to 0. Rhino is stunned, so its next attack is cancelled, which makes exhausting Spider-Man low-risk."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Threat is 0 and Rhino is stunned, so the next villain attack is cancelled. Ending the turn."},{"round":4,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Hand size is 5 now (Spider-Man form), keep the cards and draw up."},{"round":4,"kind":"window","key":"play:Great Responsibility","reasoning":"Costs 0. Converts 1 threat on a scheme at 0/7 into 1 damage on me, which is easy to heal with Aunt May."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eSandman","reasoning":"Spider-Man's basic attack on Sandman strips its Tough status (the damage is prevented). He readies at end of turn, so he can still defend. Mockingbird is at 1 HP and must not attack."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Nothing worth spending now: Mockingbird at 1 HP should not attack, and the other cards cost resources I'd rather keep. Ending turn."},{"round":5,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand and draw up."},{"round":5,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man's DEF 3 should reduce Rhino's 2 base attack plus boost to little or nothing, and he's at 9 HP. Better than taking damage or risking Mockingbird at 1 HP."},{"round":5,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Mockingbird at 1 HP would die absorbing 3 damage. Spider-Man takes 3 (8 to 5) and can recover via Aunt May."},{"round":5,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Mockingbird","reasoning":"Mockingbird at 1 HP is nearly useless and would die either way. Spider-Man at 5 HP would drop to 2-3 and get stunned if he took this hit, which is too dangerous with Sandman and Rhino still active. Sacrificing Mockingbird preserves the hero."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Peter Parker","reasoning":"Spider-Man is exhausted at 5 HP. As hero, Rhino and Sandman would attack for 5 total with no defender, which is lethal. Changing to alter-ego means they scheme instead, and Aunt May can heal 4."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Aunt May","reasoning":"Heal 4 damage from Peter Parker, bringing him from 5 to 9 HP ahead of the villain phase."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Surveillance Team|pay:Interrogation Room+Peter Parker(ability)","reasoning":"Surveillance Team gives a repeatable threat removal (1 per action, 3 counters) while we're in alter-ego, and Peter's mental resource covers part of the cost."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Surveillance Team","reasoning":"Use Surveillance Team now to remove 1 threat from The Break-In! (1 to 0)."},{"round":6,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Surveillance Team\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Only target."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Spider-Tracer\u003eSandman|pay:Heroic Intuition","reasoning":"Attaching Spider-Tracer to Sandman means defeating him removes 3 threat from the scheme. Paying with Heroic Intuition is the least valuable card."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Nothing else to do; end turn."},{"round":6,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand and draw up."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Surveillance Team","reasoning":"Crisis blocks threat removal from The Break-In! (5/7), so I need to clear Crowd Control (2 threat) first. Surveillance Team can remove 1 from a side scheme."},{"round":7,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Surveillance Team\u003eCrowd Control","reasoning":"Only target; reduces Crowd Control from 2 to 1."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Aunt May","reasoning":"Aunt May readies on my next turn anyway, so using her now is free value. Peter goes 9 to 10 before I switch to hero form, where I can't use her."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Crisis blocks main-scheme removal while Crowd Control has threat. Hero form lets Spider-Man's basic thwart clear Crowd Control's last point, then For Justice! can hit the main scheme. In alter-ego form the villains would scheme for ~4 and lose."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Spider-Man\u003eCrowd Control","reasoning":"Basic thwart removes Crowd Control's last threat, defeating the side scheme and lifting the crisis so main-scheme removal works again."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"play:For Justice!\u003eThe Break-In!|pay:Backflip+Tenacity","reasoning":"Crowd Control is gone, so main-scheme removal is legal again. Paying with Backflip and Tenacity (not mental, so 3 threat) lets me remove 3 of the 5 threat from The Break-In!. Helicarrier and Heroic Intuition are cheaper to keep."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Threat is 2/7 and Spider-Man is exhausted. Ending the turn."},{"round":7,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand and draw up."},{"round":7,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man has DEF 3 and is at 5 HP. Defending absorbs Rhino's base 2 plus boost, which is better than taking it."},{"round":8,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eSandman|pay:Heroic Intuition+Strength","reasoning":"Swinging Web Kick deals 8 to Sandman (4 HP, no tough), defeating him and triggering Spider-Tracer to remove 3 threat from The Break-In! (3 to 0). Paying with Heroic Intuition and Strength keeps Helicarrier and Webbed Up."},{"round":8,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Spider-Tracer\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Spider-Tracer removes 3 threat from The Break-In!, taking it from 3 to 0."},{"round":8,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Peter Parker","reasoning":"Spider-Man is exhausted at 6 HP. Switching to alter-ego makes Rhino scheme instead of attacking, and Aunt May can heal 4."},{"round":8,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Aunt May","reasoning":"Heal 4 from Peter Parker (6 to 10)."},{"round":8,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Threat is 0, so Surveillance Team's last counter is better saved for when threat rises. Ending turn."},{"round":8,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand and draw up."},{"round":8,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Eviction Notice\u003eexhaust","reasoning":"Exhausting Peter in the villain phase costs nothing (he's not defending in alter-ego, and he readies at round end). It removes the obligation from the game, avoiding a random discard plus surge."},{"round":9,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Surveillance Team","reasoning":"Scheme is at 2/7 and Rhino will scheme again. Using Surveillance Team's last counter removes 1 threat now, and the support is discarded once empty anyway."},{"round":9,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Surveillance Team\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Only target."},{"round":9,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Threat 1/7, Peter at full HP, no minions. Nothing efficient to add; end turn."},{"round":9,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand and draw up."},{"round":9,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Hydra Bomber\u003edamage","reasoning":"Scheme is at 5/7 with threat rising each round. Taking 2 damage on Peter at 10 HP is much safer than adding 1 threat toward the threshold."},{"round":10,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Threat is 5/7. Alter-ego would let Rhino and Hydra scheme for about 3 total, which loses the game. Hero form makes them attack instead, adding only the 1 per-round threat."},{"round":10,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eHydra Bomber|pay:First Aid+Helicarrier+Webbed Up","reasoning":"Swinging Web Kick (8 dmg) on Hydra Bomber (2 HP) defeats it without exhausting Spider-Man, so he can still defend against Rhino. Paying with Webbed Up, Helicarrier and First Aid keeps Backflip for an interrupt."},{"round":10,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Spider-Man\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Threat 5/7 is the real danger. Thwart takes it to 4. Spider-Man exhausting means no defender, but Backflip (0 cost interrupt) can prevent Rhino's attack damage."},{"round":10,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Threat is 4/7. Ending turn; Backflip is still in hand to prevent Rhino's attack."},{"round":10,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand, including Backflip."},{"round":10,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man readied in the draw step and has DEF 3. Defending reduces Rhino's damage and keeps Backflip in hand for later."},{"round":10,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Only 1 damage gets through. Backflip is better saved for a larger hit like Bomb Scare's upcoming boost."},{"round":10,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Advance has no When Revealed effect for Spider-Sense to cancel; it's just a scheme. Don't spend a card."},{"round":11,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Daredevil|pay:Black Cat+Enhanced Spider-Sense+The Power of Justice","reasoning":"Daredevil's thwart (2) is the only way to get 2 threat off the main scheme at 6/7. Paying with Power of Justice, Spider-Sense and Black Cat keeps Backflip (damage prevention) and Swinging Web Kick (8 damage)."},{"round":11,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Daredevil\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Daredevil thwart removes 2 threat, bringing The Break-In! from 6 to 4 and out of immediate lethal range."},{"round":11,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Daredevil\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Only option: 1 damage to Rhino."},{"round":11,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Threat 4/7. In hero form Rhino attacks (only the +1 per-round threat is added) and Backflip prevents the damage. Alter-ego would let Rhino scheme for an extra 1."},{"round":11,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand including Backflip and Swinging Web Kick."},{"round":11,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man at 7 HP with DEF 3 absorbs most of Rhino's attack, keeping Daredevil alive."},{"round":11,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Only 1 damage gets through; save Backflip."},{"round":12,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Daredevil\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Main scheme is the loss condition at 5/7. Daredevil's thwart removes 2 from The Break-In! (to 3). Breakin' \u0026 Takin' has no crisis, so this is legal. Spider-Man readies at end of turn and can still defend."},{"round":12,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Daredevil\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Only option."},{"round":12,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Threat 3/7. Rhino's suit absorbs attacks so attacking is wasteful. Keep Backflip and Web Kick for defense/later; end turn in hero form."},{"round":12,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:Web-Shooter","reasoning":"Must discard one; Web-Shooter is the least useful card."},{"round":12,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Hand is now at 5; draw up."},{"round":12,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man at 6 HP with DEF 3 absorbs most of Rhino's attack."},{"round":12,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Daredevil at 2 HP would die to Rhino's 2+ ATK and he's my main threat remover. Spider-Man takes the hit (6 HP, roughly 3-4 damage) and Aunt May can heal next turn."},{"round":12,"kind":"window","key":"play:Backflip","reasoning":"Backflip prevents all 3 damage to Spider-Man, keeping him at 6 HP while the villains are ramping up."},{"round":13,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Daredevil\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Main scheme is at 4/7 and the next villain phase adds 2 (per-round plus acceleration). Daredevil's thwart removes 2 and brings it to 2. He is at 1 HP and dies to the consequential damage, but he's already nearly out of play."},{"round":13,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Daredevil\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Only option."},{"round":13,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Webbed Up\u003eRhino|pay:Energy+Spider-Tracer+Swinging Web Kick","reasoning":"Webbed Up on Rhino: its next attack (boosted by Charge, +3 ATK with overkill) is replaced by discarding Webbed Up and stunning Rhino. Paying with Spider-Tracer, Energy and Swinging Web Kick, the least useful remaining cards with no minions out."},{"round":13,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Stay in hero form: Rhino's attack is cancelled by Webbed Up's stun, adding only the per-round and acceleration threat (2) to the scheme. Alter-ego would add an extra scheme point."},{"round":13,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep hand and draw up."},{"round":13,"kind":"window","key":"play:Emergency","reasoning":"Emergency costs 0 and reduces Rhino's scheme from 2 to 1. The scheme is at 4 of 7, so every point matters."},{"round":14,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Jessica Jones|pay:Avengers Mansion+Haymaker+Interrogation Room","reasoning":"Jessica Jones (THW 1+2 side schemes = 3) can defeat Crowd Control (2 threat) and lift the crisis. Paying with Interrogation Room, Haymaker and Avengers Mansion."},{"round":14,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Jessica Jones\u003eCrowd Control","reasoning":"Thwart Crowd Control for 3, defeating it (2 threat) and removing the crisis so main-scheme removal works again."},{"round":14,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Spider-Man\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Main scheme is at 5/7 and the crisis is gone. Spider-Man's thwart takes it to 4. He exhausts, so Rhino's attack would need a different answer; Rhino is stunned? No; Rhino has Webbed Up stun already used. Acceptable trade-off to lower the main threat."},{"round":14,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Alter-ego would add per-round 1 + acceleration 1 + Rhino scheme 1 to 4, reaching 7 and losing. Hero form only takes Rhino's attack damage, which Spider-Man can survive at 6 HP unless the boost is large."},{"round":14,"kind":"window","key":"play:Great Responsibility","reasoning":"Keeps the main scheme at 4/7 instead of 6/7. The 2 damage to Spider-Man is healable via Aunt May (heals 4), and the threat would otherwise put me in lethal range next round."},{"round":14,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man's DEF 3 reduces Rhino's 5 ATK to 2 plus boost. Not defending or using Jessica (overkill sends excess to me) would be lethal or nearly so at 4 HP."},{"round":14,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Hydra Bomber\u003ethreat","reasoning":"2 damage would defeat Spider-Man at 2 HP, so I must take the threat instead (4 to 5/7)."},{"round":15,"kind":"turn","key":"play:First Aid\u003eSpider-Man|pay:The Power of Justice","reasoning":"Heal Spider-Man 2 HP (to 4) before the villain phase, where Rhino and Hydra Bomber both target him. Paying with the Power of Justice keeps Surveillance Team and Helicarrier for the threat removal."},{"round":15,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Jessica Jones\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Main scheme is at 5/7. Jessica Jones removes 2 (to 3), keeping it well below the threshold before the villain phase's +2."},{"round":15,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Surveillance Team|pay:Helicarrier+Web-Shooter","reasoning":"Surveillance Team removes 1 more threat (3 to 2), the only remaining removal this turn. Paying with Helicarrier and Web-Shooter, which I can spare."},{"round":15,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Surveillance Team","reasoning":"Use Surveillance Team's counter to remove 1 threat from The Break-In! (3 to 2)."},{"round":15,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Surveillance Team\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"The main scheme is the loss condition: remove 1 from The Break-In! (3 to 2)."},{"round":15,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Staying in hero form: Spider-Man and Jessica ready at end of turn to defend, and the scheme only gains per-round plus acceleration (2). Switching to alter-ego would let both enemies scheme and could push the scheme past 7."},{"round":15,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Spider-Man's DEF 3 absorbs Rhino's base 2; at most a small boost gets through, and he's at 4 HP. Jessica Jones is at 1 HP after thwarting and would be defeated."},{"round":15,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Hydra's attack is only 1 (plus any boost). Spider-Man goes 4 to 3, which keeps Jessica Jones (1 HP) alive instead of defeating her."},{"round":15,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Jessica Jones","reasoning":"Not defending means 3+ damage to Spider-Man at 3 HP, which is lethal. Jessica Jones absorbs it and sacrifices herself (1 HP) to keep the hero alive."}],"log":["Setup: Spider-Man vs Rhino (The Break-In!).","Peter Parker draws 6 card(s).","Player chose: Keep this hand","--- Player turn, round 1 ---","Player chose: Play Mockingbird, paying: discard Genius [mental,mental]; use Peter Parker [mental]","Played Mockingbird.","Player chose: Stun Rhino","Rhino is stunned.","Player chose: Ally attack: Mockingbird deals 1 damage to Rhino (exhaust; takes 1 consequential damage)","Mockingbird attacks Rhino for 1.","Rhino takes 1 damage (13 HP left).","Mockingbird takes 1 damage.","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Done discarding; draw up to hand size","Peter Parker draws 2 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 1 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 1).","Boost card revealed: Caught Off Guard (+1).","Rhino schemes for 2.","2 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 3).","Encounter card revealed: Armored Rhino Suit (attachment).","Armored Rhino Suit attaches to Rhino.","--- End of round. Round 2 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 2 ---","Player chose: Play Nick Fury, paying: discard Great Responsibility [mental]; discard The Power of Justice [wild]; discard Enhanced Spider-